settings-credits-licenses-before = It bundles Node.js, node-pty and llama.cpp (MIT license) and the Geist and Funnel Display fonts (OFL license). Local AI runs through Ollama (MIT) with Google's Gemma 4 models, and through llama.cpp with LiquidAI's d1-2B model (LFM Open License v1.0), downloaded on demand. Agents use Claude Code or Codex with your own account. The full licenses are in the app, in the folder
